1. Date
=======

2026-01-13

2. Introduction
===============

CQD: Detection of candidate QTLs based on the GWAS results

3. Download
===========

You can download CQD from https://github.com/GouXiangJian/CQD

4. Usage
========

View documentation : perl CQD.pl -h
For example        : perl CQD.pl -i gwas_file.csv -o gwas_file.qtl

